        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "I double-checked the sheets page by page and reviewed the duplicate possibility more carefully. \ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue201\n\n### What I Found\nThere were **not many true duplicates** between the two registration copies because I already consolidated overlapping check marks. However, I did find **one likely duplicate walk-in**:\n\n- **Erin Block** is very likely the same person as registered attendee **Erin O\u2019Hara Block**\n\nSo I adjusted the totals accordingly.\n\n# Corrected Final Counts\n- **Registered attendees marked present:** 99\n- **Unique walk-ins:** 10\n- **Final estimated attendance:** 109\n- **Estimated no-shows:** 28\n\n# Final Walk-In List (Deduplicated)\n1. Mary York  \n2. Carl Carter  \n3. Michael Cass  \n4. Sanjana Ballal-Link  \n5. Michael Pratt  \n6. Alyssa Kurtz  \n7. Lauren Cardwell  \n8. Daryl Curry  \n9. Mason Bellamy  \n10. Suzanne Link  \n\n# Notes\n- \u201cErin Block\u201d was removed from the walk-in count because she appears to match the registered attendee \u201cErin O\u2019Hara Block.\u201d\n- A few handwritten names were difficult to read, but these were the clearest interpretations from the sheets.\n- No other obvious duplicates appeared across the two registration copies."
          ]
        },
