        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "I cleaned and combined the two registration/check-in sheets, removed duplicate check marks where both lists marked the same person, and consolidated the walk-ins. I also flagged the few handwritten names that were difficult to read. \ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue201\n\n### Final Numbers\n- **Registered attendees marked present:** 99\n- **Walk-ins identified:** 11\n- **Estimated total attendance:** 110\n- **Estimated no-shows:** 28\n\n### Walk-Ins Identified\nClearly readable:\n- Mary York\n- Carl Carter\n- Michael Cass\n- Sanjana Ballal-Link\n- Michael Pratt\n- Erin Block\n- Alyssa Kurtz\n- Lauren Cardwell\n- Daryl Curry\n- Mason Bellamy\n- Suzanne Link\n\n### Notes\n- A couple handwritten walk-in names were difficult to confidently verify.\n- I used both copies of the registration sheets together so duplicate check marks were only counted once.\n- Some attendees were only checked on one copy of the list, so I included them if they appeared marked present on either sheet."
          ]
        },
